data=col0,65
data=col1,Flanking
data=col2,invention_icon_perks_weapons_flanking
data=col4,Backhand, Impact and Binding Shot no longer stun and deal <col=ffffff>40%</col> more damage per rank to targets that are not facing you. Forceful Backhand, Deep Impact and Tight Bindings no longer stun and deal <col=ffffff>15%</col> more damage per rank to targets that are not facing you.
data=col5,This ability won't stun but the damage is increased by <col=ffffff>40%</col> per rank if a basic ability or by <col=ffffff>15%</col> per rank if a threshold ability.
data=col7,1,40,30
data=col7,2,140,110
data=col7,3,210,180

