data=col3,Open the tool belt to view the tools you have stored there.<br><br>Items in the tool belt do not take up an inventory slot or contribute to your weight.<br>Tools which can be added to the tool belt have an 'Add to tool belt' option in the inventory, though some tools are added automatically.
